    <rigor-reason>Modifies `.cs` in shared `Services/Communication/Engine/` (the regarding write map) — the map governs which regarding lookup the engine writes for a matched record. A wrong entry misfiles report-card associations onto the wrong lookup. BFF-touching → publish-size + CVE + bff-extensions Placement Justification + `/conflict-check` required; correctness of the regarding write demands code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5 (root §8 FULL: modifying `.cs`, tags `bff-api`).</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>P1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>A single additive map entry mirroring the 6 existing entries — fully-specified, low-ambiguity, no architectural decision. Default execution tier at `high` effort for correctness on a shared-path edit.</model-tier-reason>
